{"parse":{"title":"极限解放/孤刃走锋","pageid":5655,"revid":15486,"text":"<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><p><br />\n</p><p><br />\n</p>\n<div id=\"bread-edit\" class=\"bread-edit\" style=\"float:right;margin-top:10px;margin-right:10px\"><sup><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://wiki.biligame.com/llzj/index.php?title=%E6%9E%81%E9%99%90%E8%A7%A3%E6%94%BE/%E5%AD%A4%E5%88%83%E8%B5%B0%E9%94%8B&amp;action=edit\">编</a></sup> <sup><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://wiki.biligame.com/llzj/index.php?title=%E6%9E%81%E9%99%90%E8%A7%A3%E6%94%BE/%E5%AD%A4%E5%88%83%E8%B5%B0%E9%94%8B&amp;action=purge\">刷</a></sup> <sup><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://wiki.biligame.com/llzj/index.php?title=%E6%9E%81%E9%99%90%E8%A7%A3%E6%94%BE/%E5%AD%A4%E5%88%83%E8%B5%B0%E9%94%8B&amp;action=history\">历</a></sup></div>\n<div style=\"padding: 5px 10px;margin: 10px 0;border: 1px solid #ebccd1;border-left-width: 5px;border-radius: 3px;background: rgb(255 255 255 / 40%);\">\n<a href=\"/llzj/%E9%A6%96%E9%A1%B5\" title=\"首页\">首页</a> &gt; <a href=\"/llzj/%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD%E5%9B%BE%E9%89%B4%E5%BA%93\" title=\"技能图鉴库\">技能图鉴库</a> &gt; <b>孤刃走锋</b><br /></div>\n<hr />\n<h2><span id=\".E5.AD.A4.E5.88.83.E8.B5.B0.E9.94.8B\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"孤刃走锋\"><b>孤刃走锋</b></span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/llzj/index.php?title=%E6%A8%A1%E6%9D%BF:%E6%9E%81%E9%99%90%E8%A7%A3%E6%94%BE&amp;action=edit&amp;section=T-1\" title=\"编辑章节：\">编辑</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"width:100%;text-align:center\">\n\n<tbody><tr>\n<th colspan=\"2\">极限解放详情\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"text-nowrap\" style=\"width:20%;\" rowspan=\"3\"><img alt=\"极限解放 孤刃走锋.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/9/9d/qwjg9o56e2imbazafleewqgv3x5ejac.png/80px-%E6%9E%81%E9%99%90%E8%A7%A3%E6%94%BE_%E5%AD%A4%E5%88%83%E8%B5%B0%E9%94%8B.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"80\" height=\"80\" class=\"jndtb\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/9/9d/qwjg9o56e2imbazafleewqgv3x5ejac.png/120px-%E6%9E%81%E9%99%90%E8%A7%A3%E6%94%BE_%E5%AD%A4%E5%88%83%E8%B5%B0%E9%94%8B.png 1.5x, https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/9/9d/qwjg9o56e2imbazafleewqgv3x5ejac.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"128\" data-file-height=\"128\" /><br />孤刃走锋\n</th>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left\" style=\"width:80%;\">&#160;<img alt=\"个性一星.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/f/ff/it8jh8njwjg4jrxn4b2f0iwnlxlm1a7.png/56px-%E4%B8%AA%E6%80%A7%E4%B8%80%E6%98%9F.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"56\" height=\"14\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/f/ff/it8jh8njwjg4jrxn4b2f0iwnlxlm1a7.png/84px-%E4%B8%AA%E6%80%A7%E4%B8%80%E6%98%9F.png 1.5x, https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/f/ff/it8jh8njwjg4jrxn4b2f0iwnlxlm1a7.png/112px-%E4%B8%AA%E6%80%A7%E4%B8%80%E6%98%9F.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"224\" data-file-height=\"56\" /><br />&#160;\n<p>（被动）[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\">1级效果</span>]，自身范围<font color=\"#ed7950\">3</font>格内没有友军时，伤害、暴击伤害提高<font color=\"#ed7950\">15%</font>。\n</p>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left\">&#160;<img alt=\"个性二星.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/e/e0/s8dzgwxdvuvhjug8aqjcnr6vmgsi5ao.png/56px-%E4%B8%AA%E6%80%A7%E4%BA%8C%E6%98%9F.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"56\" height=\"14\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/e/e0/s8dzgwxdvuvhjug8aqjcnr6vmgsi5ao.png/84px-%E4%B8%AA%E6%80%A7%E4%BA%8C%E6%98%9F.png 1.5x, https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/e/e0/s8dzgwxdvuvhjug8aqjcnr6vmgsi5ao.png/112px-%E4%B8%AA%E6%80%A7%E4%BA%8C%E6%98%9F.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"224\" data-file-height=\"56\" /><br />&#160;\n<p>（被动）[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\">2级效果</span>]，自身范围<font color=\"#ed7950\">2</font>格内没有友军时，伤害、暴击伤害提高<font color=\"#ed7950\">15%</font>。\n</p>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left\">&#160;<img alt=\"个性三星.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/0/07/czx3heixk04558ia8wj7hpokhzl5cbx.png/56px-%E4%B8%AA%E6%80%A7%E4%B8%89%E6%98%9F.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"56\" height=\"14\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/0/07/czx3heixk04558ia8wj7hpokhzl5cbx.png/84px-%E4%B8%AA%E6%80%A7%E4%B8%89%E6%98%9F.png 1.5x, https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/0/07/czx3heixk04558ia8wj7hpokhzl5cbx.png/112px-%E4%B8%AA%E6%80%A7%E4%B8%89%E6%98%9F.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"224\" data-file-height=\"56\" /><br />&#160;\n<p>（被动）[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\">3级效果</span>]，伤害、暴击伤害提高<font color=\"#ed7950\">15%</font>。技能[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\">抹杀</span>]消耗能量减少<font color=\"#ed7950\">1</font>点。技能[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\">死亡的味道</span>]的回复能量条件变为：任意敌人被击败。\n</p>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"text-nowrap\" style=\"width:20%;\">解放材料\n</th>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left\" style=\"width:80%;\">\n<p>一级：20<img alt=\"虔爱之徽.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/d/d4/jsnw0rhnzqmyac2anikbbk2gxdmgss3.png/40px-%E8%99%94%E7%88%B1%E4%B9%8B%E5%BE%BD.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" class=\"jndtb\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/d/d4/jsnw0rhnzqmyac2anikbbk2gxdmgss3.png/60px-%E8%99%94%E7%88%B1%E4%B9%8B%E5%BE%BD.png 1.5x, https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/d/d4/jsnw0rhnzqmyac2anikbbk2gxdmgss3.png/80px-%E8%99%94%E7%88%B1%E4%B9%8B%E5%BE%BD.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"128\" data-file-height=\"128\" />，二级：80<img alt=\"虔爱之徽.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/d/d4/jsnw0rhnzqmyac2anikbbk2gxdmgss3.png/40px-%E8%99%94%E7%88%B1%E4%B9%8B%E5%BE%BD.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" class=\"jndtb\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/d/d4/jsnw0rhnzqmyac2anikbbk2gxdmgss3.png/60px-%E8%99%94%E7%88%B1%E4%B9%8B%E5%BE%BD.png 1.5x, https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/d/d4/jsnw0rhnzqmyac2anikbbk2gxdmgss3.png/80px-%E8%99%94%E7%88%B1%E4%B9%8B%E5%BE%BD.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"128\" data-file-height=\"128\" />，三级：180<img alt=\"虔爱之徽.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/d/d4/jsnw0rhnzqmyac2anikbbk2gxdmgss3.png/40px-%E8%99%94%E7%88%B1%E4%B9%8B%E5%BE%BD.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" class=\"jndtb\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/d/d4/jsnw0rhnzqmyac2anikbbk2gxdmgss3.png/60px-%E8%99%94%E7%88%B1%E4%B9%8B%E5%BE%BD.png 1.5x, https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/d/d4/jsnw0rhnzqmyac2anikbbk2gxdmgss3.png/80px-%E8%99%94%E7%88%B1%E4%B9%8B%E5%BE%BD.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"128\" data-file-height=\"128\" />\n</p>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"width:100%;text-align:center\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th colspan=\"1\">可习得该极限解放的角色\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><div class=\"hero_head\" style=\"width:90px;height:90px;\">\n<div class=\"hero_head_img\"><a href=\"/llzj/%E8%A7%92%E8%89%B2%E5%9B%BE%E9%89%B4%E5%BA%93/%E7%A7%91%E5%B0%94\" title=\"角色图鉴库/科尔\"><img alt=\"头像 科尔.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/c/cc/lxqu0guh5nwe7unohq6ostngk5z4c23.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"90\" height=\"90\" class=\"img-kk\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"64\" /></a></div>\n<div class=\"hero_head_name\" style=\"width:90px;\"><font color=\"#fff\">科尔</font></div>\n</div>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261022164015\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\n[SMW] In‐text annotation parser time: 0 seconds\nCPU time usage: 0.120 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.208 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 2696/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 20387/2097152 bytes\n